OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,6,Fat first. Cloud thickening into the
OL,7,Fafternoon, which will bring some
OL,8,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle at
OL,9,Ftimes. Perhaps some drier and brighter
OL,10,Finterludes. Becoming windy.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with some outbreaks of
OL,14,Flight rain and drizzle during the
OL,15,Fevening. Becoming drier with variable
OL,16,Famounts of cloud and occasional clear
OL,17,Fspells overnight. Windy. Mild and
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
