OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy start, with a
OL,6,Fnarrow band of rain moving
OL,7,Fsoutheastwards during the morning.
OL,8,FBecoming dry with bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells into the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Feasing. Warmer and more humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable cloud and bright or
OL,14,Fsunny spells on Sunday. Staying fine
OL,15,Fand dry with sunny spells on Monday
OL,16,Fand Tuesday. Becoming very warm and
OL,17,Fhumid. Lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
